<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia jobs growth to improve late '97-Vanstone.</title>
<headline>Australia jobs growth to improve late '97-Vanstone.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Employment Minister Amanda Vanstone said on Thursday the May labour force figures were consistent with the view that employment growth would not improve until later in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;The flat state of the labour market is consistent with the widely held view that substantial employment growth will not occur until later this year,&quot; Vanstone said in a statement.</p>
</text>
